UPDATE companies SET description='The firm provides a full range of electrical contracting services for residential and commercial clients. Residential work includes new construction, remodeling, additions, whole-house wiring, service upgrades, data cabling, and lighting installation. Commercial capabilities cover custom tenant finish-outs for offices, lab spaces, warehouses, retail centers, and medical clinics, as well as inspection corrections, code upgrades, troubleshooting, and ongoing building maintenance such as bulb, ballast, and breaker replacement.

Benchmark Electric serves homeowners, builders, and commercial property owners across Central Texas.

The company emphasizes integrity, safety, and neatness on every job site, and highlights its flexibility in coordinating with other subcontractors to keep projects on schedule and within budget. Its Texas Department of Licensing and Regulation license (#18725) underscores its compliance with state standards.', certifications=ARRAY['Texas Department of Licensing and Regulation License #18725']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["New Construction", "Remodeling", "Additions", "Whole House Wiring", "Service Upgrades", "Data Cabling", "Switches, Fixtures, Appliances Installation", "Chandeliers, Track, Recessed Lighting Installation", "Custom Tenant Finish-out", "Inspection Corrections", "Code Upgrades", "Troubleshooting", "Shorts, Outages, Rework", "Building Electrical Maintenance", "Replace Bulbs, Ballasts, Breakers", "Service Upgrades and Relocations", "Third Party Inspection Corrections", "Third Party Inspection Repairs", "Faulty Fixtures and Wiring Repair", "Leviton Structured Wiring", "Phone, TV, Data Wiring"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Retail", "Medical Clinics", "Offices", "Lab Spaces", "Warehouses", "Shops", "Garages", "Barns"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and locally operated", "Over 60 years of combined experience", "Flexible coordination with other subcontractors", "Commitment to safety and neatness", "Texas Department of Licensing and Regulation License #18725"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1978 -> db", "Headquarters Austin, Texas -> db", "Family-owned and locally operated -> homepage", "Founders Quenton and Clayton Walden -> homepage", "Over 60 years combined experience -> homepage", "Services: residential new construction, remodeling, additions, whole house wiring, service upgrades, data cabling, lighting -> homepage", "Services: commercial tenant finish-out, inspection corrections, code upgrades, troubleshooting, maintenance -> homepage", "Industries served: r