UPDATE companies SET description='Bernhard Woodwork Ltd. has operated from Northbrook, Illinois since 1965, when the company transplanted European cabinetmaking traditions to the Chicago area. The business was founded on the premise that architectural woodwork requires both old-world craft and modern precision, a philosophy that continues to guide its work today.

